sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Local Companion
    participant CL as Far Away Cloud
    participant AP as APNs / ActivityKit
    participant I as Native iOS
    participant U as User

    C->>CL: sanitized mobile projection
    CL->>AP: alert / Live Activity update
    AP->>I: system presentation
    I->>U: notification / Lock Screen / Dynamic Island

    Note over I,U: Dynamic Island V1 = display/deep-link only

    U->>I: LOW-risk notification action
    I->>CL: fetch fresh ActionAuthorizationChallenge
    CL-->>I: exact challenge + current projection
    I->>U: WYSIWYA
    alt Approve
        I->>U: A2 fresh device-owner authentication
    else exact non-destructive Reject
        I->>I: A1 unlocked-device gate
    end
    I->>I: sign exact response + displayDigest with MobileDevice key
    I->>I: App Attest assertion where policy requires/supports
    I->>CL: signed authorization
    CL->>CL: verify device/incarnation/binding/grant/challenge/signature/attestation
    CL->>C: exact bounded action
    C->>C: canonical PendingInteraction + authority + risk revalidation
    C-->>CL: canonical result
    CL-->>I: result projection
    I-->>U: result

    Note over U,C: HIGH / UNCLASSIFIED = A3 local desktop confirmation